#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:265
msgid ""
"The '`@llvm.nvvm.read.ptx.sreg.total_smem_size`' intrinsic reads the PTX "
"special register that holds the total amount of shared memory allocated per "
"CTA for the kernel at launch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:269
msgid ""
"The reported value includes both statically allocated and dynamically "
"requested shared memory, but excludes any shared memory reserved for system "
"use. The size is expressed in units of the architecture-specific shared "
"memory allocation granularity. For targets sm_8x and newer, this granularity "
"is 128 bytes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:274
msgid ""
"The '`aggr_smem_size`' variant returns the aggregate shared memory size, "
"including the portion reserved for system software use."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:277
msgid ""
"The '`dynamic_smem_size`' variant returns the amount of dynamic shared "
"memory allocated per CTA for the kernel at launch time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:280
msgid "'`llvm.nvvm.read.ptx.sreg.reserved_smem_offset_*`'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:294
msgid ""
"The '`@llvm.nvvm.read.ptx.sreg.reserved_smem_offset_*`' intrinsics provide "
"access to PTX special registers that hold information about reserved shared "
"memory offsets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:298
msgid ""
"The '`reserved_smem_offset_begin`' intrinsic reads the start offset of the "
"reserved shared memory region."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:301
msgid ""
"The '`reserved_smem_offset_end`' intrinsic reads the end offset of the "
"reserved shared memory region."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:304
msgid ""
"The '`reserved_smem_offset_cap`' intrinsic reads the capacity limit of the "
"reserved shared memory region."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:307
msgid ""
"The '`reserved_smem_offset_0`' and '`reserved_smem_offset_1`' intrinsics "
"read additional offsets in the reserved shared memory region."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../NVPTXUsage.md:310
msgid ""
"For more information, refer [PTX ISA](https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/parallel-"
"thread-execution/#special-registers-reserved-smem)."
msgstr ""

